write('/about/','Meet Ricardo','Meet Ricardo, owner of RG Contracting Services in Port St. Lucie.','<section class="inner-hero"><span class="eyebrow">THE PEOPLE BEHIND THE CONCRETE</span><h1>Local roots.<br>A solid connection.</h1><p>RG Contracting Services is owned by Ricardo and based in Port St. Lucie, Florida.</p></section><section class="section detail"><div><h2>Your property.<br>Your next step.</h2><p>Whether you need a new driveway, room for another vehicle, a foundation, a slab, or a culvert, the first step is a conversation about your property and your plans.</p><p>We serve all of St. Lucie County and the Okeechobee area. Explore our services to find the right place to start.</p><a class="button" href="/services/">Explore concrete services ↗</a></div><div class="monogram">RG<span>RICARDO<br>OWNER · PORT ST. LUCIE</span></div></section>'+cta())
